Information archive about the
Trion Shareware BBS package V1.10
(Previously known as Tron BBS system)
Written by Paul Spijkerman
Trion is a ShareWare multinode BBS with
RIPscrip BBS graphics, echomail, mailer
with EMSI & IEMSI, Hydra, areafix, tick,
allfiles, SplitChatDoor, CDRomDoor etc..
Controllable through scripts (by a Cron).
Fax and Voice programmes are spawnable.
Runs CliDoors, ParagonDoors, Arexx Doors,
Max's BBS Doors.
